  "description": "VEDDOB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C62 H78 Gd6 N8 O32,2(C1 H4 O1),3(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3B (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.550-3.937 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.03-112.42°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C62H78Gd6N8O32. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
